'''Spectrum''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
The whole knife has a tiger print over it. Its blade consists of a gradient from green to blue. The guard is olive green, and the handle includes a gradient from pink to orange.

== Trivia ==
*Its [https://www.roblox.com/library/168650692/Murder-Knife-Skin-Spectrum texture] was designed by [https://www.roblox.com/users/25521503/profile/ tzing44].
*This knife, along with many other knives, are from other Murder games.
*The description of this knife is: "This isn't your everyday rainbow."<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/168650692/Murder-Knife-Skin-Spectrum Model created by tzing44]</ref>

